{"case_id":"AE-024","source_case_id":"DS-076","question":"在 15 个真实网站的开放式网页任务上，哪种多模态智能体达到 59.1% 成功率，它与全工具模型和纯文本版本差多少？","question_type":"fact","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2401.13919","pages":[1,2,7]}],"reference_answer":"WebVoyager 在 15 个真实网站上达到 59.1% task success rate；GPT-4 All Tools 为 30.8%，text-only 版本为 40.1%，因此分别高 28.3 和 19.0 个百分点。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"多模态方法结果","match_any":["WebVoyager","59.1"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"全工具基线","match_any":["30.8","28.3"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"纯文本基线","match_any":["40.1","19.0"]}],"tags":["fact","web-agent","result"]}
{"case_id":"AE-025","source_case_id":"DS-077","question":"在 369 个真实计算机任务中，使用 accessibility tree 的最佳语言模型与不熟悉软件的人类总体成功率分别是多少？","question_type":"fact","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2404.07972","pages":[9,10,11]}],"reference_answer":"OSWorld 中使用 accessibility tree 的 GPT-4 总体成功率为 12.24%，而不熟悉目标软件的人类总体成功率为 72.36%，相差 60.12 个百分点。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"语言模型结果","match_any":["GPT-4","12.24"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"人类结果","match_any":["72.36","人类"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"显著差距","match_any":["60.12","差距"]}],"tags":["fact","computer-use","result"]}
{"case_id":"AE-026","source_case_id":"DS-064","question":"哪个真实领域工具交互基准让智能体与模拟用户共同操作零售和航空数据库，并用 pass^k 衡量多次试验中持续成功的可靠性？","question_type":"method","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2406.12045","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6]}],"reference_answer":"tau-bench 在 retail 和 airline 两个真实领域中让工具智能体与语言模型模拟用户对话，按照领域 policy 读写数据库；它比较最终数据库状态与目标状态，并用 pass^k 衡量同一任务连续 k 次都成功的可靠性。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"双领域与用户模拟","match_any":["retail","airline","模拟用户"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"数据库终态评价","match_any":["数据库状态","database state"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"可靠性指标","match_any":["pass^k","连续"]}],"tags":["method","tool-use","evaluation"]}
{"case_id":"AE-027","source_case_id":"DS-080","question":"一种带专用计算机接口的软件修复智能体在仓库补丁与函数修复任务上的 pass@1 分别是多少，linter 如何防止无效编辑？","question_type":"fact","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2405.15793","pages":[1,2,4]}],"reference_answer":"SWE-agent 在 SWE-bench 上达到 12.5% pass@1，在 HumanEvalFix 上达到 87.7%；其 edit 命令集成 linter，编辑后立即显示错误与上下文，并丢弃无效编辑要求智能体重试。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"仓库补丁结果","match_any":["12.5","SWE-bench"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"函数修复结果","match_any":["87.7","HumanEvalFix"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"linter 防护","match_any":["linter","无效编辑","discard"]}],"tags":["fact","software-engineering","result"]}
{"case_id":"AE-028","source_case_id":"DS-068","question":"哪种检索增强生成方法学习特殊 reflection tokens，自主决定何时检索，并逐段评价文档相关性、答案支持度与整体效用？","question_type":"method","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2310.11511","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6]}],"reference_answer":"Self-RAG 训练生成器预测 reflection tokens：Retrieve 决定何时检索，ISREL 判断文档相关性，ISSUP 判断生成内容是否被证据支持，ISUSE 评价整体响应效用；这些信号用于逐段生成、批评和选择。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"按需检索","match_any":["Retrieve","何时检索"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"相关性与支持度","match_any":["ISREL","ISSUP"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"整体效用","match_any":["ISUSE","效用"]}],"tags":["method","agentic-rag","self-reflection"]}
{"case_id":"AE-029","source_case_id":"DS-081","question":"依赖搜索或代码执行器验证后纠正输出的方法，与让同一模型直接生成反馈并改写草稿的方法，在反馈来源和可验证性上有何区别？","question_type":"cross_paper","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2305.11738","pages":[1,2,3,4]},{"paper_id":"arxiv:2303.17651","pages":[1,2,3,4]}],"reference_answer":"CRITIC 通过搜索、代码执行器等外部工具取得可观察的验证反馈，再生成 critique 并修正；Self-Refine 不依赖外部工具或训练，让同一个模型对当前输出生成 actionable feedback 后反复改写，因此反馈更便宜通用但缺少外部执行验证。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"外部工具验证","match_any":["外部工具","搜索","代码执行器"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"同模型自反馈","match_any":["同一个模型","self-feedback","actionable"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"可验证性差异","match_any":["验证","外部执行"]}],"tags":["cross-paper","reflection","comparison"]}
{"case_id":"AE-030","source_case_id":"DS-087","question":"通过语言模型模拟高风险工具执行的安全框架，与在真实零售和航空数据库上比较终态并测量 pass^k 的基准有何不同？","question_type":"cross_paper","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2309.15817","pages":[1,2,4,5,7,8,9,10,11]},{"paper_id":"arxiv:2406.12045","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]}],"reference_answer":"前者用语言模型模拟尚不存在或高风险工具及其状态，目标是低成本发现安全失败，并由自动评价器判断风险；后者在实现好的 retail/airline 数据库与 API 上执行事务，以最终数据库状态判成功，并用 pass^k 测量重复执行可靠性。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"模拟安全沙箱","match_any":["模拟","安全","风险"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"真实领域终态","match_any":["retail","airline","数据库状态"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"指标差异","match_any":["pass^k","安全评价器"]}],"tags":["cross-paper","safety","tool-use"]}
{"case_id":"AE-031","source_case_id":"DS-095","question":"从真实 issue 和 pull request 构建执行式补丁任务的基准，与通过专用计算机接口导航仓库、编辑文件并运行测试的智能体是什么关系？","question_type":"cross_paper","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2310.06770","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},{"paper_id":"arxiv:2405.15793","pages":[1,2,4,5]}],"reference_answer":"SWE-bench 定义了由真实 GitHub issue/PR 构成、通过仓库测试执行补丁的评测任务；SWE-agent 是求解这类任务的交互式系统，它通过专用 ACI 向语言模型提供仓库导航、编辑、测试和反馈能力，并在该基准上评测。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"执行式补丁基准","match_any":["issue","pull request","测试"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"专用计算机接口","match_any":["ACI","专用","导航"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"基准与求解器关系","match_any":["求解","评测"]}],"tags":["cross-paper","software-engineering","comparison"]}
{"case_id":"AE-032","source_case_id":"DS-097","question":"让生成模型学习何时检索并用特殊 token 自评的方法，与在检索后用独立轻量评价器触发精炼或网页搜索的方法有何差异？","question_type":"cross_paper","difficulty":"hard","answerable":true,"relevant":[{"paper_id":"arxiv:2310.11511","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},{"paper_id":"arxiv:2401.15884","pages":[1,2,3,4,5,6]}],"reference_answer":"Self-RAG 把 Retrieve、ISREL、ISSUP、ISUSE 等 reflection tokens 学进生成模型，在生成过程中决定检索并逐段自评；CRAG 接收已有检索结果后，用独立轻量 evaluator 判定 Correct、Incorrect 或 Ambiguous，再触发知识精炼、网页搜索或组合纠错。","key_points":[{"key_point_id":"KP-01","description":"生成器内生反思","match_any":["reflection tokens","Retrieve","ISREL"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-02","description":"独立检索评价器","match_any":["evaluator","Correct","Incorrect","Ambiguous"]},{"key_point_id":"KP-03","description":"纠错动作","match_any":["知识精炼","网页搜索","web search"]}],"tags":["cross-paper","agentic-rag","comparison"]}
